Yes, the TekRam DC390UW is based on the Symbios (LSI) 53C875.  The DC390U3W
is based on the Symbios (LSI) 53C1010.  The DC390UW will function as a boot
device in either SRM or AlphaBIOS.  I have not tried the 53C1010 devices
with SRM so I can't vouch for it's bootability.  Worst case: you may have to
boot from a floppy diskette or IDE attached hard drive.
