on my xp1000, it run mingetty on the serial port..

add the following line to /etc/inittab  (you will see were, after the
other mingettys are)


add this--> S0:2345:respawn:/sbin/mingetty ttyS0


mingetty will run the console just fine.


Also add to /etc/securetty, the following entry

add this--> ttyS0

This will allow you to login as root through the serial port.

JJ

