> cache, if that makes any difference.
> I have 128 MB, so I don't know if I can add
> another 512 MB, or just another 256 MB.

As far as I know every LX out there can take up to 4x256MB Dimms. Which
would be 1Gig. There is no difference between the 2MB and 4MB cache
versions in terms of max memory.

--rdp

