Way slow compared to what I get in Texas. Your rate is usually
limited by the source of the download. I've seen 300-350KB/sec
on a site with good bandwidth. That's about 2 T1 lines worth
of speed. On the other hand, upload is only 10-15KB/sec.

Try download a kernel from ftp://ftp.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v2.4/
and see what you get.

Wes




