You are right, and it took me a while to figure out that slots 1-4 of bank 0 are
not all in the same area of the motherboard.  They are dispersed between the two
sets of DIMM connectors!  Could it be any more confusing?

Of course, if I had looked more closely at the documentation, this wouldn't have
been a problem.
Thanks,
Ken

