I was given the priorities
1. Make it work on es40 and ds20
2. Make it work on as much of the ev6 line as you can get your hands on
3. Make it resemble the 7.1 intel release as much as possible
4. Make it install headless (ie on serial)
5. Kill as many of the unaligned trap errors as possible
6. Try and support ev56
7. Any other hardware you can lay your hands on.

